1
00:00:58,439 --> 00:00:58,880
Prince,

2
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,479
weren't you meeting His Majesty?

3
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,000
How did you get hurt?

4
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,319
I misspoke,

5
00:01:05,959 --> 00:01:06,920
upsetting His Majesty,

6
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,280
so I was punished.

7
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:11,120
You're always

8
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:12,400
so careful with His Majesty.

9
00:01:13,519 --> 00:01:14,480
Why this time...

10
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,079
Just leave.

11
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,040
I can do it myself.

12
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,319
Your injuries are all on your back.

13
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,079
Let me do it.

14
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,480
We've only been back to the capital for a few days.

15
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:29,959
The number of times you've been injured

16
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:31,560
is more than when you were leading troops in battle before.

17
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:34,079
Why don't we just go back to the border?

18
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,159
If you really can't bear to part with Miss Shen,

19
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:38,840
just take her with you.

20
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,560
If you keep talking,

21
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,439
go out and take your punishment.

22
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:45,799
Hold on.

23
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,400
I'll be more gentle.

24
00:01:59,239 --> 00:01:59,959
I can do it myself.

25
00:02:00,599 --> 00:02:01,319
You can go.

26
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,439
Don't move.

27
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,359
Be careful not to reopen the wound.

28
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:07,599
Your Highness

29
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:08,879
Are you in there?

30
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,360
Can I come in?

31
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:11,680
Clothes, clothes.

32
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:17,680
You can go.

33
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,479
Come in.

34
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:25,400
I'll leave him to you.

35
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,599
Your Highness,

36
00:02:30,759 --> 00:02:31,360
are you hurt?

37
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,120
Just a scratch.

38
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,199
It's not a big deal.

39
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:36,960
What are you here for?

40
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,840
I heard that

41
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:41,280
Western Shu's peace terms this time

42
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:42,520
are to let you

43
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,080
marry the princess of the Western Shu

44
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:45,159
to marry the princess.

45
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,560
My brother summoned me to the palace today

46
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,800
to discuss this matter.

47
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,560
You don't want me to marry her?

48
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,120
Who you marry

49
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,039
has nothing to do with me.

50
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,759
If you really like the princess,

51
00:02:58,159 --> 00:02:59,400
you'd better agree to this marriage.

52
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,120
Then the two countries can make peace,

53
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,520
and the people on the border

54
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,360
