58
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,680
I want to ask you for permission

59
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:16,000
to visit Consort Dowager Li in Lingguo Temple.

60
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,039
You want to see my mother?

61
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,120
Why?

62
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,439
I still have doubts in my heart,

63
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,159
and I want to ask Consort Dowager Li in person.

64
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,080
Don't worry.

65
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,240
I'll just ask a few questions.

66
00:03:26,599 --> 00:03:27,639
I won't disturb her peace.

67
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,240
But tomorrow is the first day of the month.

68
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:33,120
The Empress will take the concubines

69
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,280
and the female dependents of the court

70
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:35,599
to Lingguo Temple to pray for blessings.

71
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,280
Uninvited people

72
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,319
are not allowed to enter.

73
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,680
And now you

74
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:40,919
have lost your status as a legitimate daughter.

75
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,639
You absolutely cannot enter.

76
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,800
If you trust me,

77
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:45,759
I can

78
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,000
