79
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,840
Consort Dowager Li's accident

80
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,039
and my mother's death

81
00:03:51,599 --> 00:03:52,919
both happened on the Day of Prayer.

82
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:55,759
There must be a secret in Lingguo Temple.

83
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,360
I trust you.

84
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:01,919
But I have an unjust case to solve.

85
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,439
In the past,

86
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,479
I just wanted my family to live

87
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:06,680
and the bad guys to be punished.

88
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,199
Now,

89
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,800
I also want to seek the truth for myself.

90
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,199
So I must meet Consort Dowager Li in person.

91
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:15,439
You must have a way to get me into the temple, right?

92
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,199
Besides,

93
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,519
you are not young anymore.

94
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,560
It's time to consider marriage.

95
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,639
I have been stationed at the border for many years

96
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,720
and have grown accustomed to military camp life.

97
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,079
Getting married and having children

98
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,600
is not what I want.

99
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:32,720
Prince Yu,

100
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:35,600
are you used to the life in the military camp,

101
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,800
or you just can't give up

102
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,639
the dignity of commanding the three armies?

103
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,120
Your Majesty, please understand.

104
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,279
I

105
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:44,800
didn't mean to refuse.

106
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,480
But

107
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:50,079
I already have someone in my heart.

108
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,879
I dare not let the Princess of the Western Regions down.

109
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,120
It's such a happy event.

110
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,920
why didn't you tell me earlier?

111
00:04:57,839 --> 00:05:00,000
You almost made me pair the wrong couple.

112
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:02,639
You have a busy schedule.

113
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:03,839
I don't want to

114
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:05,079
bother you with this.

115
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:06,639
You

116
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,959
are my brother.

117
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,600
After father's death,

118
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:11,240
I

119
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,680
should take care of you more.

120
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:13,600
Unfortunately,

121
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,480
you were far away at the border.

122
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,720
As your elder brother,

123
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,879
I neglected to take care of you.

124
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,319
Now that you're back,

125
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,399
I'll make this marriage

126
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:22,759
for you.

127
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:25,000
I'll arrange this marriage for you

128
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:27,399
before the Western Shu Mission arrives.

129
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:28,959
Thank you, Your Majesty.

130
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,959
I do have a way

131
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:33,439
to get you into Lingguo Temple legally.

132
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,360
It's up to you if you want to cooperate with me.

133
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:36,959
How?

134
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:39,519
Be my princess consort.

135
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:42,360
As long as you have this identity,

136
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,399
you can go in and out of Lingguo Temple

137
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,199
to visit your mother.

138
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,519
I'll be your princess consort,

139
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,319
what about the princess of Western Shu?

140
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:56,040
Many noble bachelors are at court.

141
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,600
There are many people more suitable than me

142
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,519
to be the emperor's son-in-law.

143
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,040
My brother

144
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,560
is eager to marry me to the princess of Western Shu.

145
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,600
It's just

146
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:03,639
to take back

147
00:06:03,959 --> 00:06:04,839
