148
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,720
If you agree to be my princess,

149
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,480
you can help me keep my military power.

150
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,279
Then I can let you

151
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,279
enter Lingguo Temple

152
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:12,319
to visit my mother.

153
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,399
Our marriage

154
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:27,759
is just a temporary measure.

155
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:29,959
Once you achieve your goal,

156
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:31,720
you can leave as you please.

157
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,839
Only by finding the mastermind

158
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,600
can we save the Imperial Consort Dowager.

159
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:41,199
Fine,

160
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:42,680
I agree.

161
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,279
Lingguo Temple.

162
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,199
Miss, come and eat.

163
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,040
You're here.

164
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,560
Sit down and eat.

165
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:13,120
Okay.

166
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:18,839
Thank you, Your Highness.

167
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,279
After taking the medicinal diet,

168
00:07:24,639 --> 00:07:25,920
