169
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,759
I've been feeling

170
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,680
much better.

171
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,959
You are

172
00:07:30,319 --> 00:07:31,759
much more considerate than Zheng.

173
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:35,759
The decoction he sent

174
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:36,879
is bitter and hard to swallow.

175
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:38,639
Your idea is much better.

176
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,199
Medicine in food,

177
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,360
my tongue doesn't suffer anymore.

178
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:45,639
If Your Highness is in good health,

179
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:46,560
I'll be relieved.

180
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,480
You're not just

181
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:53,439
here to see me, are you?

182
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:58,160
To be honest,

183
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:00,600
I do have something to ask.

184
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:03,079
Do you remember

185
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,160
the last time

186
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,879
