187
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,079
who accompanied the Empress

188
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,079
to pray at Lingguo Temple?

189
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,000
On the first day of the lunar month,

190
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,039
the Empress, the Imperial Concubines,

191
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,720
the Imperial Princes and Princesses would come.

192
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:46,360
On the fifteenth day of the lunar month,

193
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,279
the Empress would bring some Imperial Concubines,

194
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,639
but the Imperial Princes and Princesses wouldn't come.

195
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:57,519
Other Imperial Relatives would avoid the first and the fifteenth.

196
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:00,960
The day when the Imperial Consort Dowager was attacked

197
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,360
was the fifteenth.

198
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:04,960
Your Highness.

199
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,279
Your Highness.

200
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:09,519
We've just received a message from the temple.

201
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,519
Princess Consort didn't return last night.

202
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:12,720
This morning,

203
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:13,639
after the Imperial Consort Dowager informed us,

204
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:15,120
the temple has mobilized everyone to search.

205
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:16,120
But she's still missing.

206
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:11,960
Sui'er.

207
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:13,639
Sui'er.

208
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:14,639
Sui'er.

209
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,080
Let go, Sui'er.

210
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:20,360
Sui'er.

211
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:22,440
Sui'er.

212
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:23,360
It's me.

213
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,720
Sui'er.

214
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,519
Sui'er.

215
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:30,159
Sui'er.

216
00:10:48,759 --> 00:10:49,360
You're awake.

217
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:54,960
You must have

218
00:10:55,399 --> 00:10:56,600
had a hallucination just now.

219
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,279
Hallucination.

220
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,320
It's all an illusion.

221
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,519
It's all an illusion.

222
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,159
It's taro powder.

223
00:11:13,159 --> 00:11:13,720
Taro powder.

224
00:11:32,879 --> 00:11:34,000
I finally saw clearly.

225
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:36,720
The person who killed me

226
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:38,759
was actually him.

227
00:11:48,559 --> 00:11:49,600
Don't you want to explain

228
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,720
why you were there just now?

229
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,480
Your Highness.

230
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,200
Did you get anything out of it?

231
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,559
The nun insisted that

232
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:16,279
she mistook the intruder for a bad guy.

233
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:17,320
She insisted that

234
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,799
the hallucinogenic drug had nothing to do with her.

235
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,440
When I asked her a few more questions,

236
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:21,480
she bit her tongue and killed herself.

237
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:23,879
Since there is such a loyal dog,

238
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,320
it seems that the Lingguo Temple

239
00:12:25,759 --> 00:12:27,120
has been infiltrated by a powerful master.

240
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:29,799
I'm pretty sure

241
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,559
the poison I was just hit with

242
00:12:31,799 --> 00:12:32,559
is taro powder.

243
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:35,039
But the Second Prince is already dead.

244
00:12:35,519 --> 00:12:37,360
His alchemy workshop has been closed.

245
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:40,039
The medicine of Ling Chuchu

246
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:42,000
was also found in the Prince Rui's Mansion.

247
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,200
Now the mansion has been closed,

248
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,559
and no one is allowed to get close.

249
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:48,360
Who else has this medicine?

250
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:50,399
Investigate it.

251
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:51,639
Yes.

252
00:13:01,879 --> 00:13:02,840
Although I promised you

253
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:03,960
to not ask about your secret,

254
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,000
but since you are my princess consort,

255
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,000
you should cherish your life.

256
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,159
At least,

257
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,879
don't lose your life for nothing

258
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,399
before the Western Shu Mission leaves.

259
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,360
It was my carelessness this time.

260
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,039
But don't worry,

261
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,759
before we separate,

262
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,879
I will never cause you any trouble.

263
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,480
Don't be too arrogant.

264
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,799
I'm not afraid of any trouble.
